WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.791
This script begins a transaction It lowercases and
trims emails

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:11.514
only when the stored value is actually different
RETURNING shows which rows

00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:17.875
changed Then ROLLBACK discards the changes This

00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:22.652
is a useful teaching pattern because you can inspect
the effect without permanently modifying the

00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:23.428
source table
